22	/**
23	 * The GraphRAG retriever: this is the piece that turns plain vector RAG into
24	 * *graph* RAG.
25	 *
26	 * <pre>
27	 *   1. Embed the question.
28	 *   2. Vector search over :Chunk.embedding to find the most relevant
29	 *      free-text passages ("seed" nodes) -- this is exactly what a
30	 *      vector-only pipeline would stop at.
31	 *   3. For each seed chunk, walk up to two hops out through the graph
32	 *      (Chunk -[:MENTIONS]-> entity -[any]- ... ) to pull in connected
33	 *      facts a text chunk alone can't express: which release fixed a bug,
34	 *      which customers reported it (Bug -> Ticket -> Customer is two hops),
35	 *      whether it's still open, etc.
36	 *   4. Return chunk text + graph facts together as retrieved Content.
37	 * </pre>
38	 */
